{"availability":"available","full":"gyoomei/mimobrain","name":"mimobrain","description":"🧠 Daily brain workout — 24 puzzles across 5 cognitive domains with Socratic AI mentor that refuses to give answers. 6 agents · Powered by Xiaomi MiMo V2.5 · Free · No API key","category":"Education","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-05-23T22:06:18Z","updated":"2026-05-23T22:22:20Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://gyoomei.github.io/mimobrain/","topics":["ai","bilingual","brain-training","education","free","github-pages","lateral-thinking","mimo","no-api-key","pollinations","puzzles","single-html","socratic","vanilla-js","xiaomi-mimo"],"demo":"https://gyoomei.github.io/mimobrain/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:56.242Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:56.242Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T20:10:56.242Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T20:10:56.242Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Daily brain workout powered by Xiaomi MiMo V2.5 — train your mind through lateral thinking, riddles, memory games, math puzzles, and pattern recognition. Real-time Socratic chat with Mentor MiMo who never gives away the answer.","Traditional answer-driven Q&A turns AI into a vending machine: pull the lever, get the candy. You learn nothing.","Socratic dialog treats the AI as a tutor with a rule: never reduce the cognitive load. Every reply must contain at least one new question. The user does the thinking; the mentor only narrows the search space. Done well, you arrive at the answer believing you found it yourself — because you did."],"features":["Never answer directly. Always reply with at least one leading question.","Validate the user's current reasoning before correcting it.","Break the problem into the smallest possible step, ask about that step only."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/gyoomei/mimobrain/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"920f85efeb3333ff78